          "value": "yang fire (丙). For her, this is the **harsh controlling star** (七殺, \"seven killings\") — force applied without agreement, pressure, demand. In the traditional female reading, also the *unofficial* partner category: the intense, unconventional kind. Its dominant expression is not romance; it's strain. See `elements.partner-star`.",
