          "value": "her register for inner work is systems/hardware-software/operator — something installed that can be uninstalled, access revoked, territory reclaimed. \"Healing\" and \"wound\" assume damage and put her in a victim position; she rejects them. Applies to how her self-work is described generally. `[hers]`",
